OL,3,CBP puts North Sea business up for sale
OL,4,Cafter 60 years of production
OL,6,FBP has said it is putting its UK North
OL,7,FSea business up for sale after 60
OL,8,Fyears of production.
OL,10,FThe energy giant said the decision to
OL,11,Fmarket the business for a potential
OL,12,Fsale is part of its strategy to slim
OL,13,Fdown the group by selling off parts of
OL,14,Fthe business.
OL,16,FThe announcement comes after Prime
OL,17,FMinister Andy Burnham did not rule out
OL,18,Ffuture North Sea drilling as details
OL,19,Fof his call with Donald Trump last
OL,20,Fweek have emerged.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
