OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785516479
OL,3,CBP puts North Sea business up for sale
OL,4,Cafter 60 years of production
OL,6,FBurnham told the US president "we
OL,7,Fcan't ignore" the resources in the
OL,8,Farea and said he would "take a
OL,9,Fpragmatic approach when it comes to
OL,10,Fthe North Sea".
OL,12,FHe said: "There is a resource there.
OL,13,FWhen people are struggling, we can't
OL,14,Fignore that."
OL,16,FBurnham has faced pressure from some
OL,17,Ftrade unions and industry figures as
OL,18,Fwell as some of his own Labour MPs to
OL,19,Fback increased drilling in the region.
OL,26,@rD@NO]tD@JOUvD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
