PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785516479
OL,3,CBP puts North Sea business up for sale
OL,4,Cafter 60 years of production
OL,6,FDespite this, Labour's 2024 manifesto
OL,7,Fsaid the party would not issue new
OL,8,FNorth Sea licences, and former Energy
OL,9,FSecretary Ed Miliband was firmly
OL,10,Fagainst the expansion of drilling, but
OL,11,Fnow sits as Foreign Secretary.
OL,13,FTrump has publicly expressed his
OL,14,Fsupport and desire to expand oil
OL,15,Fdrilling in the region, posting on
OL,16,FTruth Social the day before Burnham
OL,17,Fofficially took office, claiming that
OL,18,Fthe new PM had said he would open up
OL,19,FNorth Sea Oil.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
