OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785516479
OL,3,CBP puts North Sea business up for sale
OL,4,Cafter 60 years of production
OL,6,FHe wrote: "The People of Aberdeen, in
OL,7,FScotland, are dancing in the streets
OL,8,Fbecause the new Prime Minister, Andy
OL,9,FBurnham, has stated that he will be
OL,10,Fopening up, all the way, the
OL,11,Finvaluable North Sea Oil!
OL,13,F"It is one of the Greatest Sources of
OL,14,Fquality Oil on Earth, has hundreds of
OL,15,Fyears of Capacity left, with much not
OL,16,Feven found yet, and will make the
OL,17,FUnited Kingdom, from a Poverty
OL,18,FStricken Disaster, to one of the
OL,19,FRichest Countries anywhere in the
OL,20,FWorld!"
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
