OL,3,CBP puts North Sea business up for sale
OL,4,Cafter 60 years of production
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FBP's North Sea operation has five
OL,12,Fproduction hubs - two in the central
OL,13,FNorth Sea, and three west of Shetland
OL,14,F- and has produced 117,000 barrels of
OL,15,Foil equivalent per day in 2025.
OL,17,FAround 1,100 staff work for the North
OL,18,FSea arm of the business, part of BP's
OL,19,Fapproximately 13,960 UK workforce.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
