CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785516479
OL,3,CBP puts North Sea business up for sale
OL,4,Cafter 60 years of production
OL,6,FBP chief executive Meg O'Neill said
OL,7,Fshe believed the North Sea business
OL,8,Fwould be "better positioned as part of
OL,9,Fanother company".
OL,11,F"The North Sea remains integral to the
OL,12,FUK's energy system," she said.
OL,14,F"However, as we focus our portfolio
OL,15,Fand direct capital to our highest-
OL,16,Fvalue opportunities, we believe our
OL,17,FNorth Sea business will be better
OL,18,Fpositioned as part of another company.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
