OL,3,CBP puts North Sea business up for sale
OL,4,Cafter 60 years of production
OL,6,F"It has world-class people, resilient
OL,7,Fassets and a proud heritage, and it is
OL,8,Fprecisely these qualities that can
OL,9,Fattract an owner ready to back its
OL,10,Fnext chapter."
